WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The accident film contained no broken glass.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The question changed. The footage did not.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Some later reported seeing glass.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Later information can affect recall.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Report and mechanism are not identical.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Preserve the first account. Trace added details.
